==Notes and trivia==
* The town was under the control of the [[Barov]] family.<ref>{{Both}} [60D] [[Barov Family Fortune]]</ref>
* There is a small well of fresh spring water in the center of town.<ref>{{Horde}} [[File:Shaman (Class Icon).png|16px]] [22] [[Call of Water (4)]]</ref> 
* In ''Warcraft II'', Tarren Mill was located near the coast.
* The mailbox and stable master, unlike nearly every other town, is not in front of the inn.
* Newer players, who are not paying attention, often call Tarren Mill "Tauren Mill" and sometimes "Terran Mill".

